    "findings": [
      "The entry, compatibility page, reverse Infantry Lasgun page, release indexes, and blessing map consistently cover exactly the one Efficiency trait on the Kantrael Mk VII, Mk IIb, and Mk IX; actual IDs, names, and UI evidence agree.",
      "The four cooldown tiers are 1.25/1/0.75/0.5 seconds. A new instance is ready, firing refreshes the timer even while cooling down, the fired-but-missed case is explicit, and an empty-clip dry fire is correctly excluded. The off-cooldown keyword is independent of held-slot display; switching does not pause the timer, while removing the source item removes the blessing.",
      "The source formula round(u/3) with final clip clamping matches actual 3/2/3 base ammo use and 1/1/1 reduced use. Sufficient-clip savings are 2/3, 1/2, and 2/3; the one-round clip boundary correctly shows no extra savings. The examples state their assumptions and the 0.3-second refresh correctly moves the IV-tier deadline to 0.8 seconds.",
      "The RAW 66% wording and tier formatter are reconstructed without template duplication. The 50% Mk IIb result is identified as a mark-limited numeric discrepancy; the Mk VII/IX 66.7% results are treated as a normal approximation.",
      "Image identity weapon_trait_048, full game icon path, attachment URL, and image evidence are kept distinct and agree across the formal entry and map. No unsupported gameplay-test or FASTER claim appears."
    ],
